OL,3,GNEWSABid to save Sefton aviary defeated
OL,4,Aafter tetchy debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to pause the closure of an
OL,7,Fhistoric aviary has been rejected by
OL,8,FSefton Council.
OL,10,FA motion put forward by the Liberal
OL,11,FDemocrats calling for a halt to the
OL,12,Fclosure of the aviary at Churchtown
OL,13,FBotanic Gardens, pending further
OL,14,Fassessments, was defeated on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
