OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABid to save Sefton aviary defeated
OL,4,Aafter tetchy debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn July, the council confirmed it
OL,7,Fplanned to close the aviary in March
OL,8,F2027, claiming it was not keeping up
OL,9,Fwith the modern animal welfare
OL,10,Fstandards expected for the birds in its
OL,11,Fcare and costs associated with
OL,12,Fmaintaining its infrastructure were too
OL,13,Fgreat.
OL,15,FA petition of over 500 signatures had
OL,16,Fcalled for the aviary to be saved, but
OL,17,FLabour councillor Catie Page defended
OL,18,Fthe closure alleging the birds were in
OL,19,F"an appalling state".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
